WEBVTT

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.300
<i>Toru, do you know their location?</i>

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.260
<i>Wait...</i>

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.040
<i>They keep jumping.</i>

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.370
<i>They're headed upward!</i>

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:12.040
<i>They intend to destroy the hub of the company headquarters.</i>

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.240
<i>Stop them!</i>

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.100
I'll go first.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.450
<i>Toru, let's attack them from both sides.</i>

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.010
<i>Madoka, you're with Fu.</i>

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.020
Don't slow me down, okay?

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.870
Why?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.750
Why do you fight?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.540
I... I'm...

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.120
You don't have any reason at all, do you?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.280
Do you want to die?

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.360
Toru!

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.550
Okay!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.290
Toru!

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:21.610
Did we get her?

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.040
It'll take more than that.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.920
Get off of me!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.570
When I look closely, you're cute.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.930
You don't need to look closely!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.430
Doing this kind of thing doesn't suit you.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.670
Cut it out! You're icky!

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.040
Hey! What are you doing?

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.010
Get off!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.610
Underestimate me and you'll get hurt!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.590
What's this?

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:13.920
What happened?

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:25.100
Looks like they're going at it over there too.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.300
Fu, huh? Where's Madoka?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:32.100
Toru!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:41.110
If it's two against one, Fu's at a disadvantage. Let's go!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.840
Now it's three against two.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:24.950
If you don't want to die, you shouldn't come to these kinds of places, should you?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.540
There's no reason you have to display loyalty...

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:37.310
...toward the owner who took you in off the street, since she's only using you too.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.710
First of all, you don't know anything about that woman, right?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.620
I...

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.920
No, it's no good to strain yourself like that.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.390
You need to relax your shoulders more.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.430
Now that's dangerous.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.110
Hmm?

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.850
I do have a reason why I came here!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.530
Because your father made the sky like this?

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.490
I can do this too!

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:13.930
Who do you think you have to thank for that power?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:20.850
The emergence of children with Dynamis also occurred because the world became like this.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.780
Isn't that conceivable?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.220
That's...

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:29.150
The universe is given direction by a great Will.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.990
That flow is irreversible.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:39.960
Both the sky turning this way and all of you receiving your powers are in accordance with that flow.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.800
And these things are also the will of the Professor.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.160
That kind of stuff is just empty talk!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:50.270
There's no use trying to turn back the clock.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.960
So, this is the Professor's...

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:10.490
Yeah...

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.860
"Eliminate anyone who stands in our way."

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.200
It's the Professor's will, you know.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:29.080
Tatsuya!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.170
Madoka!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.120
Hey, we're going too!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.200
Tatsuya!

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.420
Fu!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.130
You lot can't win with what power you have.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:34.730
If you say you're going to stand by this bunch to the bitter end, I'll kill you right here.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:38.570
Justice is on our side.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.950
What you're doing is just terrorism, isn't it?!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.790
No, it's different. We're trying to protect this world.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.230
How can you say that after making such a mess of the world?!

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.700
If anyone are terrorists, it's that bunch.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.830
We're fighting for a sacred purpose.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.350
It's about time to finish this.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:22.490
Got him!

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:26.960
You...

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.930
That hurts, you know.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.500
Wait! Haven't you noticed?

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:42.950
It's them.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:43.910
This is bad!

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:49.680
See you around!

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.650
Till next time.

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.400
Did they run away?

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.570
Tatsuya, are you okay?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.580
Yeah.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.650
I couldn't do anything.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:24.920
You did pretty well, for your first time.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.230
Oh, I see.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:46.870
Apparently the children are fine.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.350
Well then, where shall we go?

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:04.760
You decide, Fuijisaki. I'm totally worn out!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.430
Really, I'd rather have gone home to bed.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.370
What's the problem? We came all this way anyway.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.640
She told us to have some fun for a change, and we even got some spending money!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.240
After all that work, we deserved it.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.920
Hey, Madoka, isn't there someplace you want to go?

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.940
Me? Not especially.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:31.690
Well, should we go to karaoke or something?

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.660
Look, look! This is totally freaky!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.200
She's the one living it up the most!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.820
In any case, I got to see a lot of faces from the past today.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:10.720
Quite impressive that you located them, those kids.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.130
I went to a lot of trouble to do so.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:18.300
They say that a few years after Twin X,

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:22.530
...children were born with paranormal powers around the world.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.510
They were called superiors,

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.550
...and it was talked about as an effect of electromagnetic waves,

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:31.980
...and as a portent, even, of a new evolution.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:38.010
The rumors themselves died down soon though.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:44.390
Something on the order of bending spoons and such is of no practical use whatsoever.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:49.500
But those children are different.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:58.710
<i>Seems a lot like this is your first time in the Settlement too, huh?</i>

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:03.470
<i>Well, excuse you! The two of us came here a lot before, right, Fujisaki?</i>

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:04.850
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.180
<i>I only came here twice with my mom.</i>

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:16.260
<i>What kind of places were you all in before coming to the Countess's?</i>

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.950
<i>Fujisaki was in a juvenile treatment center.</i>

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.920
<i>And I...</i>

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.100
<i>Or something like that.</i>

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:32.940
<i>Anyway, let's just say a lot's happened to all of us.</i>

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:40.450
<i>Bought and sold here and there, and now we just happen to belong to that woman!</i>

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:48.260
<i>I'm grateful to her. If she hadn't gotten me, I don't know what would have happened.</i>

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.860
<i>I guess...</i>

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:59.000
I'm a bit jealous of you, Dr. Kageyama.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.300
What?

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:05.700
I suppose your gathering those children together was for the sake of fighting Terumichi Madoka.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:09.740
Or rather, Enkidu.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:11.710
But still...

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.450
Dr. Enuma...

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.990
I mean, if only I had kids like those around me all the time...

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.030
Actually, I also should have...

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:34.330
At that time, I recall you were away from Uruk because in your belly you were carrying...

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:41.310
That's why this is revenge for me,

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:44.050
...revenge on that sky.

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.060
Oh!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.400
Hey, let's play that!

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.770
All right! Keep coming, keep coming...

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.390
Boy, you're terrible at this.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.590
What? You're the one making someone else do it.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.530
That's how things are, right? Men have got to work.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.630
All right, I'm next!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.530
It's cheating if you use Dynamis, okay?

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:52.420
Hey there, girl, where are you from?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.320
If you want a stuffed animal, how about we get one for you?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:56.850
You're bugging me.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:57.720
What?!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.060
Get out of my sight, jerks.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.020
What's with you?

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.860
Let's go.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.820
Just a second!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.970
Ow!

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:09.800
Don't!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.230
That hurt, you know! Apologize!

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:13.640
I'm sorry.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.300
Not you! That girl!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:20.380
I'll apologize for her.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:22.110
Fujisaki...

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.580
Won't you accept that?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.640
Then kneel down on the ground.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:28.950
I'm sor...

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.490
One shot from me too!

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.390
<i>No! No using it in front of people!</i>

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.630
Let up on me already, please.

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:45.530
You laughing at us? You!

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:56.110
Don't be tryin' to show off, dumbass!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.010
Idiot! He's got no brains, that guy!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.680
Are you okay?

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:11.330
Having mysterious powers can be a real nuisance, huh?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.690
At times like this...

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:03.640
<i>I wonder why we have this kind of power?</i>

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.580
<i>Hard to say.</i>

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:12.150
<i>How was it that the Countess tracked all of you down?</i>

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:16.560
<i>Because she's got money.</i>

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:21.900
<i>Now that you mention it, that woman Enuma was saying things...</i>

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.900
<i>...like that seeing us brought back memories.</i>

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:26.800
<i>I wonder if she knows something?</i>

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.210
Oh!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.070
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:32.010
Oh, sorry...

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:36.350
In that room... Don't you remember that there was a picture?

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:37.310
Not really...

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:43.220
Tatsuya was in it, together with the Countess.

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:45.660
I was?

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:46.790
Yeah.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.560
Just a second...

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:25.490
Dad and the Countess...

00:23:24.850 --> 00:23:29.050
You've become capable of quite inhuman things too, haven't you?

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:31.490
You and Kiyoko were bought by me.

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:34.360
I gave those children a sound punishment for it.

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:36.290
You need to bear in mind your situation...

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:38.030
...and become a bit more of an adult.

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:42.330
He was a superb scientist and was wonderful as a human being.

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:45.240
At this point, there's no use in your knowing such things, is there?

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:49.170
That I needed you two to fight against Gilgamesh?

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:53.270
Your father changed absolutely everything with XX.
